{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_161_1000_033sih", "source_sha256": "d3aacc5353d345ffd6706fb6abc44837bb119e3e7bb9654a64633f2e8e18678e", "ja": "歌織さん、まつりさん。\n今度の定期公演、\nよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "歌织小姐，茉莉小姐。\n下次的定期公演，\n请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_161_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "21e6f06d3dd2fdd7a45a51255493ac6ea7bd67836d0a9f76169dcca7149b1ea6", "ja": "こちらこそよろしくなのですよ。\n志保ちゃん、新曲は\nもう聞いたのです？", "zh": "我才要请你多多关照呢。\n志保，你已经听过新歌了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_161_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "d434c84112e0b43055b7fe9ab14d65eeb900daa861caa88501cc15c61ed1d44b", "ja": "はい。{$P$}さん\nに、デモ音源を聞かせてもらって。\n大人っぽい曲でした。", "zh": "是的。{$P$}先生\n让我听了试听音源。\n是一首很成熟的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_161_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "c57154f38ddde6e42b54bf6620649985a5dac4a8caa9a387675575d9a47ccf41", "ja": "そうなのね。\n志保ちゃんは大人っぽいから、\nそれでかしら？　ふふっ。", "zh": "原来如此。\n志保很成熟，\n所以是这个原因吗？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_161_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "2014429e49240bd45a0bf2a977a4002eae2700bbd9be3d7c494523bc00b20241", "ja": "大人っぽい……\nそうでしょうか。", "zh": "成熟……\n会是这样吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
